IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MAGICPONY-TREE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DRAFT-COUNT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACCEPTED-TOKENS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MAGICPONY.
    IF DRAFT-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100 = 100 + (ACCEPTED-TOKENS * 85).

    SET depth 4.
    WEIGHT 32 SPEEDUP-RATIO-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 ACCEPTED-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
